      "label": "Genre cycles and production planning",
      "role": "historical_object",
      "atlasDecision": "NO_PRODUCTION_CASE",
      "chapterFunction": "Westerns, comedies, melodramas, war films and other recurring forms allowed companies to coordinate audience expectation, stars, sets, crews and marketing without making every film identical."
    },
